     'Each message would have sat in one place instead of the several places they had filed it', 'D'),
    ('Brightline Health: Mail Late, Messages Early', 5, 'What was Aditi reasoning for refusing it?',
     'The change request had not been approved',
     'The clinicians had been promised full fidelity',
