     'It would have breached the service level agreement', 'C'),
    ('Brightline Health: Mail Late, Messages Early', 6, 'Why did the label structure make the mail migration slower than its message count suggested?',
     'A message filed under several labels has to be placed several times, so the work exceeds the message count',
     'Labels have to be recreated before any message can move',
     'The destination rejects messages carrying more than one label',
