    ('Brightline Health: Mail Late, Messages Early', 10, 'Which sentence best summarises the whole briefing?',
     'A message migration that finished early because it was scheduled second',
     'Two cutovers delayed by a shared helpdesk constraint',
     'Two cutovers where the fast one was fast for a structural reason and the slow one was slow for one too',
