    ('Cardinal Freight: The Drive That Was Not In Scope', 2, 'Why was adding it a change request rather than a clarification?',
     'The price assumed per-user permissions, and a Shared Drive needs group permissions mapped one by one',
     'The eleven terabytes exceeded the contracted volume',
     'The customer had not signed the discovery report',
     'The operations team had not attended the kickoff call', 'A'),
    ('Cardinal Freight: The Drive That Was Not In Scope', 3, 'What went wrong on the MESSAGE side?',
     'Direct messages were not carried across',
